
Pkg
---

.. ada:set_package:: Pkg


.. ada:function:: function Foo (X : Standard.Integer) return Standard.Integer
    :package: Pkg

    :spark_mode: ``Off``


.. ada:function:: function Foo (X : Standard.Integer; Y : Standard.Integer) return Standard.Integer
    :package: Pkg

    :spark_mode: ``Off``


.. ada:function:: function Foo (S : Standard.String) return Standard.Integer
    :package: Pkg

    :spark_mode: ``Off``

    Three overloaded Foo functions with distinct parameter
    profiles. Tier 3 collision-keying keeps all three
    reachable via :ada:func:`Foo`.
